;: clocks.lca (3042PC84-70), hand-written: I/O block clocks on every die edge
Version 2
Design 3042PC84 9 0
Speed -70
Editblk EF
Base FG
Config X:QX Y: F:A:B:C:D G: DX:F DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:K
Equate F = A*B*C*D
Endblk
Editblk GG
Base FG
Config X:QX Y: F:A:B:C:D G: DX:F DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK:K
Equate F = A*B*C*D
Endblk
Editblk P13
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P57
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P20
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:OQ TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P21
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:OQ TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P5
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:OQ TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P6
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:OQ TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P60
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:OQ TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P61
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:OQ TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P40
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:OQ TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P41
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:OQ TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P18
Base IO
Config IN:IQ:FF OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P19
Base IO
Config IN:IQ:FF OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P7
Base IO
Config IN:IQ:FF OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P8
Base IO
Config IN:IQ:FF OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P62
Base IO
Config IN:IQ:FF OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P63
Base IO
Config IN:IQ:FF OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P44
Base IO
Config IN:IQ:FF OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Editblk P45
Base IO
Config IN:IQ:FF OUT: TRI:
Endblk
Addnet GPAD TCLKIN.I GCLK.I
Addnet APAD BCLKIN.I ACLK.I
Addnet GK GCLK.O EF.K P21.OK P5.OK P60.OK P40.OK P18.IK P8.IK P62.IK P44.IK
Addnet AK ACLK.O GG.K P20.OK P6.OK P61.OK P41.OK P19.IK P7.IK P63.IK P45.IK
Addnet Q0 P18.Q EF.A
Addnet Q1 P19.Q EF.B
Addnet Q2 P7.Q EF.C
Addnet Q3 P8.Q EF.D
Addnet Q4 P62.Q GG.A
Addnet Q5 P63.Q GG.B
Addnet Q6 P44.Q GG.C
Addnet Q7 P45.Q GG.D
Addnet O0 EF.X P20.O P21.O P5.O P6.O
Addnet O1 GG.X P60.O P61.O P40.O P41.O
